  <p id="c-jinshu-066-taokan-sons-intro:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-066-taokan-sons-intro:p001:m0000" ref="twd_erg_kmz">侃</persName>有子十七人，唯<persName id="c-jinshu-066-taokan-sons-intro:p001:m0008" ref="61k_gq3_ip8">洪</persName>、<persName id="c-jinshu-066-taokan-sons-intro:p001:m0010" ref="5r7_x6g_gtf">瞻</persName>、<persName id="c-jinshu-066-taokan-sons-intro:p001:m0012" ref="cgr_q7b_cos">夏</persName>、<persName id="c-jinshu-066-taokan-sons-intro:p001:m0014" ref="07z_b9y_29n">琦</persName>、<persName id="c-jinshu-066-taokan-sons-intro:p001:m0016" ref="0wt_4fd_ozd">旗</persName>、<persName id="c-jinshu-066-taokan-sons-intro:p001:m0018" ref="byj_6mo_vpe">斌</persName>、<persName id="c-jinshu-066-taokan-sons-intro:p001:m0020" ref="5fa_457_ec8">稱</persName>、<persName id="c-jinshu-066-taokan-sons-intro:p001:m0022" ref="9ec_nm1_cfh">範</persName>、<persName id="c-jinshu-066-taokan-sons-intro:p001:m0024" ref="287_n93_pi3">岱</persName>見舊史，餘者並不顯。</p>
